WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A risk register names an uncertain event, likelihood, consequence, response and owner. A reserve should trace to such risks.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Late shipping can have low part cost but high schedule impact; record both dimensions instead of one “risk score.”

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Risk register

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
These are teaching relationships, not live prices, quotes, tax advice or a forecast. State every assumption.

